  "description": "18'' x 24'' Poly Lawn Roller with Threaded Plug, Combination Push and Tow Roller for Lawn and Garden Tractors, 270 lbs Capacity\nFeatures\nEffortless Lawn Care: Our lawn roller features a push/pull combo that tackles both tight corners and expansive areas with ease; Ideal for smoothing out uneven patches and preparing your lawn for a pristine look after winter damage or mole activity\nRobust and Reliable: Built with a sturdy 5.5mm thick plastic roller and reinforced with side ribs, this roller resists deformation and ensures long-lasting durability; Suitable for both home gardeners and professional landscapers\nVersatile Maneuver: The easy-turn threaded plug prevents leakage, ensuring a smooth experience when filling and emptying; Holding up to 28 gallons (270 lbs) of water or sand, our roller is both light to handle and solid for towing behind a tractor\nCompact and Convenient Storage: Once your lawn is perfectly flattened, simply drain and hang the sticker burr roller in your garage or shed; Its compact size and lightweight construction make storage a breeze, saving you valuable space\nProtect Your Lawn: Designed for practicality, our lawn roller water filled has rounded drum edges to minimize lawn damage during turns, and the metal scraper bar above the drum ensures it stays clear of debris while in use",
